You "gently" slam your saws into the wounds of a creature, dealing [65%, 80%, 91%, 101%, 110% (TL1-5)] weapon damage and deepening the wounds.

All bleeding wounds durations are increased by [0, 1, 1, 1, 1 (TL1-5)] turns and the damage by [152%, 205%, 246%, 281%, 311% (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] (this may be done only once per bleeding effect).

When this happens a gush of blood is projected in a narrow cone of radius 4, dealing [140, 188, 226, 258, 286 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] physical damage to all creatures.

The power and damage improves with your Steampower.

''The marvels of technology, now at the service of true butchery!''
